<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>🍵 Mathca Match-up Invitation!</title>
    <style>
        /* CSS Styles */
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #a7ffb6;
            color: #333;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .container {
            background-color: #ffffffc0;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            max-width: 450px;
            width: 90%;
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        h1 {
            color: #5d4037;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-size: 2em;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #8d6e63;
            font-weight: normal;
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 1.2em;
        }

        .details p {
            font-size: 1.1em;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        /* Flexbox container for the forms/buttons */
        .button-group-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            margin-top: 25px;
            gap: 15px; /* Space between buttons */
        }

        /* Style for the individual forms to take up equal space */
        .rsvp-form {
            flex-grow: 1;
            /* Ensures form doesn't add extra margin/padding */
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        /* Styling for the submit buttons */
        .rsvp-button {
            width: 100%; /* Make button fill its form container */
            padding: 12px 15px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 1em;
            transition: background-color 0.3s, transform 0.1s;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
            color: white;
            font-weight: bold;
            box-sizing: border-box; /* Include padding in width calculation */
        }

        .accept {
            background-color: #4CAF50; /* Green for Accept */
        }

        .unaccept {
            background-color: #f44336; /* Red for Unaccept */
        }

        .accept:hover {
            background-color: #45a049;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .unaccept:hover {
            background-color: #da190b;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .coffee-icon {
            font-size: 3em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #5d4037;
        }

        /* Responsive adjustments for smaller screens */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .container {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }
            h1 {
                font-size: 1.8em;
            }
            .button-group-wrapper {
                flex-direction: column; /* Stack buttons on very small screens */
            }
            .rsvp-form {
                margin-bottom: 15px; /* Space between stacked forms */
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="coffee-icon">🍵</div>
        <h1>Let's Matcha-up!</h1>
        <h2>Coffee, Matcha, and Conversation.</h2>

        <div class="details">
            <p><strong>WHERE:</strong> maybematcha Tamarind Square</p>
            <p><strong>WHEN:</strong> 11/12 October 2025 (Subject to your availability)</p>
            <p><strong>TIME:</strong> 8.00AM - YTD</p>
            <p><strong>THINGS TO PREPARE:</strong> laptop & any other tools for your work</p>
        </div>

        <div class="button-group-wrapper">
            <form 
                action="https://formspree.io/f/xanppedv" 
                method="POST" 
                class="rsvp-form"
            >
                <input type="hidden" name="RSVP" value="ACCEPTED - I'll be there!">
                <input 
                    type="submit" 
                    class="rsvp-button accept" 
                    value="🎉 I'll Be There!" 
                >
            </form>

            <form 
                action="https://formspree.io/f/xanppedv" 
                method="POST"
                class="rsvp-form"
            >
                <input type="hidden" name="RSVP" value="DECLINED - Cannot make it.">
                <input 
                    type="submit" 
                    class="rsvp-button unaccept" 
                    value="😞 Can't Make It"
                >
            </form>
        </div>

        <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-style: italic; color: #777;">
            Click a button to let me know! Feel free to deliver your concerns through whatsapp
        </p>
    </div>
    
</body>
</html>
